Microsoft Corporation, located at One Microsoft Way, Redmond, Washington 98052‑6399, can be reached at (425) 882‑8080 and via its investor relations website www.microsoft.com/investor. The company’s securities registered under Section 12(b) of the Securities Exchange Act consist of:  

- Common stock, $0.00000625 par value per share (trading symbol MSFT) listed on NASDAQ;  
- 3.125% Notes due 2028 (trading symbol MSFT) listed on NASDAQ;  
- 2.625% Notes due 2033 (trading symbol MSFT) listed on NASDAQ.  

No securities are registered under Section 12(g).  

Regarding filing status: Microsoft is a well‑known seasoned issuer (Yes), it is required to file reports under Sections 13 or 15(d) (No, it is not exempt), and it has filed all required reports for the preceding 12 months and has been subject to those filing requirements for the past 90 days (Yes).
